T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-30\" d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"1249\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(97,725)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"556\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-716)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-64\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"556\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1766\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2823,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"2235\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n<g transform=\"translate(96,770)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-79\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2032\" x=\"706\" y=\"513\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"794\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"1183\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"1653\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<g transform=\"translate(60,-771)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-78\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2032\" x=\"809\" y=\"408\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-28\" x=\"867\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-3B8\" x=\"1256\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-29\" x=\"1726\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"5576\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6632,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(120,0)\">\n<rect stroke=\"none\" width=\"620\" height=\"60\" x=\"0\" y=\"220\"></rect>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"60\" y=\"676\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-30\" x=\"60\" y=\"-687\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"7493\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>To see what's happening, let's zoom in and observe the behavior of the curve at this point. </p>\n<div id=\"graphic-9801ad606f79eb77bb3de7fd4a0e486e\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/9801ad606f79eb77bb3de7fd4a0e486e\"></div>\n\n<p>If we look carefully, we notice that the tangent lines become steeper and steeper as we approach the point <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.766ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 760.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-6-Title\">C</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> from either direction.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-396a4fa76091cf721c0c08a711613f67\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/396a4fa76091cf721c0c08a711613f67\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, as we take the <em>limit</em> as we approach <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.413ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1039 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-7-Title\">C,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E7-MJMAIN-2C\" d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E7-MJMAIN-2C\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> it would appear that these tangent lines become vertical. </p>\n<div id=\"graphic-ce96fa17a8b9cf883d8b168ad019b51f\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ce96fa17a8b9cf883d8b168ad019b51f\"></div>\n\n<p>When the limit of the tangent lines becomes vertical like this, we say that the curve has a vertical tangent at <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.413ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 1039 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-8-Title\">C.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMATHI-43\" d=\"M50 252Q50 367 117 473T286 641T490 704Q580 704 633 653Q642 643 648 636T656 626L657 623Q660 623 684 649Q691 655 699 663T715 679T725 690L740 705H746Q760 705 760 698Q760 694 728 561Q692 422 692 421Q690 416 687 415T669 413H653Q647 419 647 422Q647 423 648 429T650 449T651 481Q651 552 619 605T510 659Q484 659 454 652T382 628T299 572T226 479Q194 422 175 346T156 222Q156 108 232 58Q280 24 350 24Q441 24 512 92T606 240Q610 253 612 255T628 257Q648 257 648 248Q648 243 647 239Q618 132 523 55T319 -22Q206 -22 128 53T50 252Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E8-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMATHI-43\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E8-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"760\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n           \n                </div>        \n                    \n            </div>",
